 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Attouteki Gacha un de Isekai wo Nariagaru!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "圧倒的ガチャ運で異世界を成り上がる！"
   },
   {
    "en": "Creating a Better Life in Another World by Winning Gachas with my Overwhelming Luck!"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Rose Suddenly in the Alternate World by Overwhelming Gacha with Luck!"
   },
   {
    "id": "Bangun di dunia yang berbeda dengan keberuntungan gacha yang luar biasa!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Overworked Salaryman Jinta dies in a traffic accident and meets the Goddess Leafa. Due to Jinta's good karma he was supposed to be sent to Heaven, but during an argument the two of them were accidentally reincarnated to another world, much to Jinta's delight. Discovering that his Luck stat has gone beyond the maximum of 99 to 999999, Jinta plans to live his life to fullest by taking advantage of the Gacha system that this world runs on.",
   "ja": "「一発で当ててやるよ　特賞（SSSR）をな！」　交通事故で帰らぬ人となったジンタは、天界の女神・リーファと念願だった異世界へと転生を果たす。しかし転生中、ジンタのステータスに異常が発生。運の数値が最大値の｢99｣を超えた｢999999｣になっていた！　桁外れの強運を手に入れたジンタは、アイテム賭場のガチャで無双し始め…!?"
  },
